{"id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-isomorphism.md","title":"Structure Isomorphisms","display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-isomorphism","aliases":["17-df-isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms","depends_on":["[[17-df-embedding]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive","source_verification":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；普通嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a>。函数、像集与双射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选集合函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 的省略语言下标只在同一个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 下使用；它不是两个结构编码的字面相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[|\\mathfrak A|]=|\\mathfrak B|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;:=\\{f\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{|\\mathfrak A|}:\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[|\\mathfrak A|]=|\\mathfrak B|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;:=\\{f\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{|\\mathfrak A|}:\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本册的普通嵌入已经逐项写出常元、函数及关系的保持/反射条件，故本定义不再依赖缺失的第57本结构编码。同构保持全部公式的结论另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3784f7fc076663f9\" href=\"?note=3784f7fc076663f9\" title=\"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction\">17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction</a>；“满的初等嵌入”与此同构接口等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；普通嵌入 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。函数、像集与双射见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$f$ 为候选集合函数。$\\cong$ 的省略语言下标只在同一个固定 $L$ 下使用；它不是两个结构编码的字面相等。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；普通嵌入 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。函数、像集与双射见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$f$ 为候选集合函数。$\\cong$ 的省略语言下标只在同一个固定 $L$ 下使用；它不是两个结构编码的字面相等。","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3784f7fc076663f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本册的普通嵌入已经逐项写出常元、函数及关系的保持/反射条件，故本定义不再依赖缺失的第57本结构编码。同构保持全部公式的结论另见 [[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]；“满的初等嵌入”与此同构接口等价。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[|\\mathfrak A|]=|\\mathfrak B|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&:=\\{f\\in|\\mathfrak B|^{|\\mathfrak A|}:\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B\n&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B&\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\cong_L\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1677,"backlinks":[{"id":"48d3ae3ee6d03d67","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，语言、结构及一阶句子真值见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]；同构见 [[17-df-isomorphism]]。$\\mathscr L,\\mathscr L_1,\\mathscr L_2$ 是固定的语义接口：对每个 $L\\in\\mathcal V$，$S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 是句子编码的一个集合；$E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)$ 是在 $\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\sigma\\in S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 上给定的二值谓词。它们是固定的可定义类参数；下式是关于这些接口的元理论模式，不把全语言上的赋值误作一个集合，也不量化一个 ZFC 内部真谓词。$\\Gamma$ 为句子集合。$\\mathrm{FO}$ 是由下式完全指定的一阶语义接口。"},{"id":"cd3e154dc1b3bfce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\kappa$ 为候选集合。$\\operatorname{Iso}_L$ 采用 [[17-df-isomorphism]]；下列首式是该普通同构集与满初等嵌入集的等价表示，见 [[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$K$ 是以固定集合论公式给出的 $L$-结构元类；涉及 $K$ 的量词是该公式的受限量词展开，而非 ZFC 中对真类的量化。$K_0$ 是一个集合，承担可数同构代表集的角色。$\\operatorname{PartIso}$、$\\cong_L$ 的语言始终为此处固定的 $L$，见 [[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[17-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"dd42e4c43322822e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartIso}$ and $\\cong$ (partial isomorphism and isomorphism, see [[17-df-partial-isomorphism]] and [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"7aaf4c313fa6fd4d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"c96ab493df8372c8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"97a5b6dd9bfa3001","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"2b5fa486b2ca4645","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"dfe6cf29ee360a19","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"33d0ef62a50d6129","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"6ca15fee71357037","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"6738c8e9f2e3c32e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"82f8e7c92cfb99ea","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])"